Description:

Appending the DEPTH suffix to a metadata entry name is now bounded by the
space left in the buffer rather than by the buffer's total size.  Previously a
long enough entry name could be written past the end of its allocation.

Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-64v2-6mm8-jq9f.


